metadata/design_notes = "A sprint board: two long dividers split the room into three columns, like a board of to-do, doing and done, joined only along the top and bottom walls. A side door lets the player into an outer column, a top or bottom door into the middle one, and crossing from one column to another means walking to the end of the board with the enemies in the next column tracking them along it."
